    "Choose a classic StuffIt (.sit) archive. Other archive formats, including .sitx, aren’t supported." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the 'Unable to Open' alert, shown when the user drops or opens a file that is not a .sit file. '.sit' and '.sitx' are file name extensions; keep them exactly as written, including the dot. 'StuffIt' is a trademark (a Mac compression program popular in the 1990s); keep it exactly as written. 'Classic' refers to the classic Mac OS era - Macintosh computers of the 1980s and 1990s - not 'classical' or 'traditional'. 'Archive' means a compressed file container (like a .zip file) - here an old StuffIt .sit file - not a records archive, an archive room, or a backup.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kies 'n klassieke StuffIt (.sit) argief. Ander argiefformate, insluitend .sitx, word nie ondersteun nie."
          }
        },
        "am" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ክላሲክ StuffIt ( .sit ) ማህደር ይምረጡ። ሌሎች የማህደር ቅርጸቶች፣ .sitx ጨምሮ፣ አይደገፉም።"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اختر أرشيف StuffIt ( .sit ) الكلاسيكي. لا يتم دعم تنسيقات الأرشيف الأخرى، بما في ذلك .sitx ."
          }
        },
        "az" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klassik StuffIt (.sit) arxivi seçin. .sitx da daxil olmaqla digər arxiv formatları dəstəklənmir."
          }
        },
        "be" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выберыце класічны архіў StuffIt (.sit). Іншыя фарматы архіваў, у тым ліку .sitx, не падтрымліваюцца."
          }
        },
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Изберете класически архив от типа „StuffIt“ (.sit). Други формати на архиви, включително .sitx, не се поддържат."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "একটি ক্লাসিক StuffIt ( .sit ) আর্কাইভ বেছে নিন। .sitx সহ অন্যান্য আর্কাইভ ফরম্যাট সমর্থিত নয়।"
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trieu un arxiu clàssic StuffIt (.sit). No s'admeten altres formats d'arxiu, inclòs .sitx."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
