    "Choose a local archive and folder." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown in an archive's Details when the archive or the destination is not an ordinary file or folder on this Mac (for example a web address). 'Local' means stored on this computer or a connected disk. 'Archive' means a compressed file container (like a .zip file) - here an old StuffIt .sit file - not a records archive, an archive room, or a backup.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
