    "Drop StuffIt archives here" : {
      "comment" : "Large prompt inside the dashed drop area of the main window: the user drags .sit files from Finder and drops them here. 'Drop' is the drag-and-drop verb (release the dragged files), not 'let fall' or 'discard'. 'StuffIt' is a trademark (a Mac compression program popular in the 1990s); keep it exactly as written. 'Archive' means a compressed file container (like a .zip file) - here an old StuffIt .sit file - not a records archive, an archive room, or a backup.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
