    "Extraction stopped. Files already recovered remain in the output folder." : {
      "comment" : "First line of an archive's Details when the user pressed Stop while it was being extracted. It reassures the user that files unpacked before stopping were kept. 'Output folder' is the new folder that receives the unpacked files. 'Extraction' is the process of unpacking the files stored inside an archive; use the term macOS itself uses for this in your language (as Archive Utility does).",
