      "comment" : "Item in the 'Save To' pop-up menu: saves extracted files in the same folder that contains each original archive (the default). Same meaning as the label 'Next to each archive'; capitalize it the way macOS capitalizes menu items in your language. 'Archive' means a compressed file container (like a .zip file) - here an old StuffIt .sit file - not a records archive, an archive room, or a backup.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
